 r←Test_Init_96(debugFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;T2;rc;log
⍝ Exercise `RunThese` with a subset: group functions of groups not selected must not be reported as misnamed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
